  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Causa is built in layers: a seasoned yellow potato mash pressed around a filling to create a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "terrine"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "terrine"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " shape. The mash is seasoned with lime juice and chilli paste in place of the traditional "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "aji-amarillo"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "aji amarillo"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " chilli. The dish is served cold, which makes it suited to preparing ahead."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Tip: mash the potato while it is still hot. Cold potato becomes stiff and lumpy and will not press together cleanly."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "ingredientsList",
        "attrs": {
          "defaultServings": 4,
          "items": [
            {
